Sub-section (2) of Section 16 empowers the FSSAI to, by regulations, inter alia specify, (i) the standards and guidelines in relation to articles of food; (ii) the limits for use of food additives etc.;
(iii) the mechanisms and guidelines for accreditation of certification bodies engaged in certification of food safety management systems; (iv) the procedure and the enforcement of quality control in relation to food imported into India; (v) the method of sampling and analysis of food items;
and, (vi) to conduct survey of enforcement and administration of the Act etc.
